---
---

<div class="vd">
  <div class="vd__header">
    <h1 class="vd__title">Kalkulator vrednotenja delnic</h1>
    <p class="vd__subtitle">
      Oceni pošteno vrednost delnice s pomočjo zvezne različice Mauboussin/McKinsey formule
      za ciljni P/E - na podlagi pričakovane rasti dobička, donosnosti na vloženi kapital (ROIC)
      in stroška kapitala (WACC).
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="vd__explainer">
    <h2 class="vd__explainer-title">Kako deluje ta kalkulator</h2>
    <p>
      Osnovna ideja: podjetje si "zasluži" določen P/E glede na to, kako donosno (ROIC) in kako hitro
      raste. Kalkulator izračuna, kakšen P/E bi bil upravičen glede na te dve stvari (<strong>ciljni P/E</strong>),
      in ga primerja s P/E, ki ga trg trenutno plačuje. Če trg plačuje manj, kot bi bilo upravičeno, je
      delnica po tem modelu poceni (Undervalued) - in obratno.
    </p>

    <h3>Kaj pomenijo posamezni vnosi</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>P/E (FWD)</strong> - trenutna cena delnice deljena s pričakovanim dobičkom na delnico za naslednjih 12 mesecev. Najdeš ga na straneh kot Yahoo Finance, Stockanalysis.com ali v poročilih analitikov.</li>
      <li><strong>ROIC (%)</strong> - donosnost na vloženi kapital (return on invested capital). Pove, koliko dobička podjetje ustvari na vsak evro/dolar, vložen v posel. Visok in stabilen ROIC je znak kakovostnega, konkurenčno zaščitenega podjetja.</li>
      <li><strong>Ocena rasti EPS (%)</strong> - tvoja ocena, za koliko odstotkov letno bo rasel dobiček na delnico v prihodnjih letih. To je najbolj negotova številka v celotnem modelu - majhna sprememba tu precej spremeni rezultat.</li>
      <li><strong>WACC (%)</strong> - tehtani povprečni strošek kapitala, poenostavljeno donosnost, ki jo vlagatelji zahtevajo za tveganje tega podjetja. Bolj tvegana/zadolžena podjetja imajo višji WACC.</li>
      <li><strong>Trenutna cena</strong> - trenutna tržna cena delnice.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Od kod pride ciljni P/E</h3>
    <p>
      Formula (Mauboussin/McKinsey) razdeli vrednost podjetja na dva dela: (1) vrednost dobička, ki ga podjetje
      že ustvarja in ga izplača delničarjem med napovednim obdobjem, ter (2) diskontirano vrednost tega, kar podjetje
      "obdrži" na koncu tega obdobja. Ključno pravilo: <strong>čim višji je ROIC glede na rast</strong>, tem manj
      kapitala podjetje potrebuje za financiranje rasti in tem višji P/E si "zasluži". Podjetje z visoko rastjo,
      a nizkim ROIC (kot npr. Tesla v primeru spodaj), dejansko uniči vrednost, ker rast financira z
      nizko-donosnim kapitalom - zato lahko formula za takšna podjetja vrne zelo nizek ali celo negativen ciljni P/E.
    </p>

    <h3>Kako brati rezultat</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>Fer vrednost</strong> je cena, ki bi jo delnica imela, če bi trg plačeval ciljni P/E namesto trenutnega.
      <strong>Upside/Downside</strong> je razlika med fer vrednostjo in trenutno ceno. Oznaka <strong>Undervalued/Overvalued</strong>
      se sproži, ko ta razlika preseže pragova, ki ju nastaviš zgoraj (privzeto ±15 %) - vmes je "Fair Value".
    </p>

    <h3>Kaj model ne zajame</h3>
    <p>
      Številke povedo samo pol zgodbe. Preden se zaneseš na rezultat, preveri še kakovostne dejavnike podjetja:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Trajnost konkurenčne prednosti</strong> - ali ima podjetje prepoznavno blagovno znamko, cenovno moč in dosledno visok ROIC skozi čas, ne le v enem dobrem letu</li>
      <li><strong>Prosti denarni tok</strong> - ali dobiček dejansko pretvarja v gotovino, ne le v računovodski izkaz</li>
      <li><strong>Zadolženost</strong> - nizek dolg glede na EBITDA pomeni manj tveganja v slabših časih</li>
      <li><strong>Ciklikavost</strong> - ali dobički rastejo dosledno ali nihajo z gospodarskim ciklom</li>
      <li><strong>Ponavljajoči prihodki</strong> - ali stranke izdelek/storitev kupujejo znova in znova, ali gre za enkratni nakup</li>
      <li><strong>Vračanje kapitala</strong> - ali podjetje izplačuje rastočo dividendo ali odkupuje lastne delnice</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="vd__explainer-warning">
      Rezultat je zelo občutljiv na oceno rasti in WACC - obe sta subjektivni oceni, ne dejstvi. Model je
      pripomoček za razmišljanje, ne napoved prihodnje cene, in ni finančni nasvet.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="vd__assumptions">
    <h2 class="vd__section-title">Skupne predpostavke</h2>
    <div class="vd__assumptions-grid">
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">FWD P/E S&amp;P 500</span>
        <input type="range" id="a-sp-pe-r" min="5" max="40" value="16" step="0.5" class="vd__slider" />
        <input type="number" id="a-sp-pe" value="16" step="0.1" class="vd__number" />
      </label>
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">Povprečni ROIC S&amp;P 500 (%)</span>
        <input type="range" id="a-sp-roic-r" min="0" max="30" value="16" step="0.5" class="vd__slider" />
        <input type="number" id="a-sp-roic" value="16" step="0.1" class="vd__number" />
      </label>
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">Prag Undervalued, upside ≥ (%)</span>
        <input type="range" id="a-th-under-r" min="0" max="50" value="15" step="1" class="vd__slider" />
        <input type="number" id="a-th-under" value="15" step="1" class="vd__number" />
      </label>
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">Prag Overvalued, downside ≤ (%)</span>
        <input type="range" id="a-th-over-r" min="-50" max="0" value="-15" step="1" class="vd__slider" />
        <input type="number" id="a-th-over" value="-15" step="1" class="vd__number" />
      </label>
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">Napovedno obdobje (let)</span>
        <input type="range" id="a-years-r" min="1" max="30" value="15" step="1" class="vd__slider" />
        <input type="number" id="a-years" value="15" step="1" min="1" class="vd__number" />
      </label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="vd-companies" class="vd__companies"></section>

  <button type="button" id="vd-add" class="vd__add-btn">+ Dodaj podjetje</button>

  <p class="vd__footnote">
    Ciljni P/E = payout ratio (1 − rast/ROIC) × faktor rastoče anuitete + diskontirana terminalna vrednost, izračunano po WACC za izbrano napovedno obdobje.
    Fer vrednost = trenutna cena × (ciljni P/E / trenutni P/E FWD).
  </p>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .vd {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md) var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .vd__header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .vd__explainer {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .vd__explainer-title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .vd__explainer h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .vd__explainer p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .vd__explainer ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .vd__explainer li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .vd__explainer strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .vd__explainer-warning {
    background: var(--color-highlight-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-highlight-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .vd__title {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .vd__subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .vd__section-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .vd__assumptions {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .vd__assumptions-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* One indicator per row: label | slider | number box */
  .vd__field {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 15rem minmax(0, 1fr) 5.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .vd__field-label {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .vd__number {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    width: 100%;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .vd__number:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--color-accent-bg);
  }

  .vd__slider {
    width: 100%;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-border);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border: none;
  }

  .vd__slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent);
  }

  .vd__slider::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-accent);
  }

  .vd__slider::-moz-range-track {
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-border);
    border: none;
  }

  .vd__slider:hover::-webkit-slider-thumb,
  .vd__slider:focus::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .vd__slider:hover::-moz-range-thumb,
  .vd__slider:focus::-moz-range-thumb {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .vd__slider:focus {
    outline: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .vd__field {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 5rem;
    }
    .vd__field-label {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }
  }

  .vd__companies {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .vd-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .vd-card__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .vd-card__name {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .vd-card__name:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .vd-card__remove {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .vd-card__remove:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
    background: var(--color-surface-hover);
  }

  .vd-card__remove:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .vd-card__inputs {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .vd-card__result {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .vd-kpi {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
  }

  .vd-kpi__label {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .vd-kpi__value {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .vd-kpi__hint {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .vd-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 9px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .vd-badge--under {
    background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.1);
    color: #059669;
    border: 1px solid rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3);
  }

  .vd-badge--over {
    background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
    color: #dc2626;
    border: 1px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.25);
  }

  .vd-badge--fair {
    background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.1);
    color: #b45309;
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.25);
  }

  .vd__add-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    width: 100%;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .vd__add-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-bg);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-border);
  }

  .vd__footnote {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-subtle);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .vd-card__result {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  interface Company {
    id: string;
    name: string;
    pe: number | null;
    roic: number | null;
    growth: number | null;
    wacc: number | null;
    price: number | null;
  }

  interface Assumptions {
    spPe: number;
    spRoic: number;
    thUnder: number;
    thOver: number;
    years: number;
  }

  let idCounter = 0;
  function newCompany(partial: Partial<Company> = {}): Company {
    idCounter += 1;
    return {
      id: `c${idCounter}`,
      name: '',
      pe: null,
      roic: null,
      growth: null,
      wacc: null,
      price: null,
      ...partial,
    };
  }

  let companies: Company[] = [
    newCompany({ name: 'Microsoft (MSFT)', pe: 21.5, roic: 29, growth: 15, wacc: 8, price: 390 }),
  ];

  function getAssumptions(): Assumptions {
    return {
      spPe: Number((document.getElementById('a-sp-pe') as HTMLInputElement).value) || 16,
      spRoic: Number((document.getElementById('a-sp-roic') as HTMLInputElement).value) / 100 || 0.16,
      thUnder: Number((document.getElementById('a-th-under') as HTMLInputElement).value) / 100 || 0.15,
      thOver: Number((document.getElementById('a-th-over') as HTMLInputElement).value) / 100 || -0.15,
      years: Number((document.getElementById('a-years') as HTMLInputElement).value) || 15,
    };
  }

  function fmtPct(v: number): string {
    return `${(v * 100).toLocaleString('sl-SI', { maximumFractionDigits: 1 })} %`;
  }

  function fmtNum(v: number, decimals = 1): string {
    return v.toLocaleString('sl-SI', { minimumFractionDigits: decimals, maximumFractionDigits: decimals });
  }

  // Mauboussin/McKinsey continuous target P/E formula - mirrors the source spreadsheet's
  // N/O/P/Q/R/S helper columns (payout ratio x growing-annuity factor + discounted terminal value).
  function computeTargetPE(growth: number, roic: number, wacc: number, years: number): number | null {
    if (roic === 0 || wacc <= -1) return null;
    const payout = 1 - growth / roic;
    const growthFactor = (1 + growth) / (1 + wacc);
    const annuity = Math.abs(growthFactor - 1) < 1e-7
      ? years
      : (growthFactor * (1 - Math.pow(growthFactor, years))) / (1 - growthFactor);
    const explicitValue = payout * annuity;
    const terminalRaw = Math.pow(1 + growth, years) / wacc;
    const terminalValue = terminalRaw / Math.pow(1 + wacc, years);
    const result = explicitValue + terminalValue;
    return Number.isFinite(result) ? result : null;
  }

  interface CompanyResult {
    targetPe: number | null;
    fairValue: number | null;
    upside: number | null;
    peRemium: number | null;
    roicPremium: number | null;
    badge: string;
  }

  function computeResult(c: Company, a: Assumptions): CompanyResult {
    const pe = c.pe;
    const roic = c.roic !== null ? c.roic / 100 : null;
    const growth = c.growth !== null ? c.growth / 100 : null;
    const wacc = c.wacc !== null ? c.wacc / 100 : null;
    const price = c.price;

    let targetPe: number | null = null;
    let fairValue: number | null = null;
    let upside: number | null = null;
    let peRemium: number | null = null;
    let roicPremium: number | null = null;

    if (roic !== null && growth !== null && wacc !== null) {
      targetPe = computeTargetPE(growth, roic, wacc, a.years);
    }
    if (price !== null && targetPe !== null && pe) {
      fairValue = price * (targetPe / pe);
    }
    if (price !== null && fairValue !== null) {
      upside = fairValue / price - 1;
    }
    if (pe !== null) peRemium = pe / a.spPe - 1;
    if (roic !== null) roicPremium = roic / a.spRoic - 1;

    let badge = '';
    if (upside !== null) {
      if (upside >= a.thUnder) badge = '<span class="vd-badge vd-badge--under">Undervalued</span>';
      else if (upside <= a.thOver) badge = '<span class="vd-badge vd-badge--over">Overvalued</span>';
      else badge = '<span class="vd-badge vd-badge--fair">Fair Value</span>';
    }

    return { targetPe, fairValue, upside, peRemium, roicPremium, badge };
  }

  function renderResultHTML(r: CompanyResult): string {
    return `
      <div class="vd-kpi">
        <div class="vd-kpi__label">Ciljni P/E</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__value">${r.targetPe !== null ? fmtNum(r.targetPe) + 'x' : '-'}</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__hint">${r.peRemium !== null ? `P/E premija: ${fmtPct(r.peRemium)}` : ''}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vd-kpi">
        <div class="vd-kpi__label">Fer vrednost</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__value">${r.fairValue !== null ? fmtNum(r.fairValue, 2) : '-'}</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__hint">${r.roicPremium !== null ? `ROIC premija: ${fmtPct(r.roicPremium)}` : ''}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vd-kpi">
        <div class="vd-kpi__label">Upside / Downside</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__value" style="${r.upside !== null ? `color:${r.upside >= 0 ? '#059669' : '#dc2626'}` : ''}">${r.upside !== null ? (r.upside >= 0 ? '+' : '') + fmtPct(r.upside) : '-'}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="vd-kpi">
        <div class="vd-kpi__label">Ocena</div>
        <div class="vd-kpi__value">${r.badge || '-'}</div>
      </div>
    `;
  }

  function sliderField(label: string, field: string, value: number | null, min: number, max: number, step: number, placeholder: string): string {
    const v = value ?? '';
    const sliderValue = value ?? (min + max) / 2;
    return `
      <label class="vd__field">
        <span class="vd__field-label">${label}</span>
        <input type="range" class="vd__slider" data-slider-for="${field}" min="${min}" max="${max}" step="${step}" value="${sliderValue}" />
        <input type="number" class="vd__number" data-field="${field}" step="${step}" value="${v}" placeholder="${placeholder}" />
      </label>
    `;
  }

  function renderCompanyCard(c: Company, a: Assumptions): string {
    const result = computeResult(c, a);
    return `
      <div class="vd-card" data-id="${c.id}">
        <div class="vd-card__header">
          <input type="text" class="vd-card__name" data-field="name" placeholder="Ime podjetja" value="${c.name.replace(/"/g, '&quot;')}" />
          <button type="button" class="vd-card__remove" data-action="remove" title="Odstrani podjetje" ${companies.length <= 1 ? 'disabled' : ''}>×</button>
        </div>
        <div class="vd-card__inputs">
          ${sliderField('P/E (FWD)', 'pe', c.pe, 0, 60, 0.5, 'npr. 21.5')}
          ${sliderField('ROIC (%)', 'roic', c.roic, 0, 50, 0.5, 'npr. 29')}
          ${sliderField('Ocena rasti EPS (%)', 'growth', c.growth, -10, 40, 0.5, 'npr. 15')}
          ${sliderField('WACC (%)', 'wacc', c.wacc, 3, 20, 0.25, 'npr. 8')}
          ${sliderField('Trenutna cena', 'price', c.price, 0, 1000, 1, 'npr. 390')}
        </div>
        <div class="vd-card__result" id="vd-result-${c.id}">
          ${renderResultHTML(result)}
        </div>
      </div>
    `;
  }

  function renderAll() {
    const a = getAssumptions();
    const container = document.getElementById('vd-companies')!;
    container.innerHTML = companies.map((c) => renderCompanyCard(c, a)).join('');
  }

  function updateAllResults() {
    const a = getAssumptions();
    for (const c of companies) {
      const el = document.getElementById(`vd-result-${c.id}`);
      if (el) el.innerHTML = renderResultHTML(computeResult(c, a));
    }
  }

  // Keep a slider and its paired number input in sync without rebuilding the DOM,
  // so dragging a range input mid-gesture never loses pointer capture.
  function syncPairs(root: ParentNode) {
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('.vd__field').forEach((row) => {
      const slider = row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('.vd__slider');
      const number = row.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('.vd__number, input[type="number"]');
      if (!slider || !number) return;
      slider.addEventListener('input', () => {
        number.value = slider.value;
        number.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));
      });
      number.addEventListener('input', () => {
        if (number.value !== '') slider.value = number.value;
      });
    });
  }

  // Assumptions panel: sliders/numbers sync each other and recompute all results.
  syncPairs(document.querySelector('.vd__assumptions')!);
  document.querySelectorAll('.vd__assumptions input').forEach((el) => {
    el.addEventListener('input', updateAllResults);
  });

  document.getElementById('vd-add')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
    companies.push(newCompany());
    renderAll();
  });

  const companiesEl = document.getElementById('vd-companies')!;

  companiesEl.addEventListener('input', (e) => {
    const target = e.target as HTMLInputElement;
    const card = target.closest<HTMLElement>('.vd-card');
    if (!card) return;
    const id = card.dataset.id;
    const field = target.dataset.field as keyof Company | undefined;
    if (!field || !id) return;

    const company = companies.find((c) => c.id === id);
    if (!company) return;

    if (field === 'name') {
      company.name = target.value;
      return; // name doesn't affect the calculation, no need to recompute
    }

    const num = target.value === '' ? null : Number(target.value);
    (company as any)[field] = num;

    const el = document.getElementById(`vd-result-${id}`);
    if (el) el.innerHTML = renderResultHTML(computeResult(company, getAssumptions()));
  });

  companiesEl.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    const btn = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="remove"]');
    if (!btn) return;
    const card = btn.closest<HTMLElement>('.vd-card');
    if (!card) return;
    const id = card.dataset.id;
    if (companies.length <= 1) return;
    companies = companies.filter((c) => c.id !== id);
    renderAll();
  });

  renderAll();
  syncPairs(companiesEl);

  // New cards are added via renderAll(), which rebuilds the DOM - reattach slider sync each time.
  const companiesObserver = new MutationObserver(() => syncPairs(companiesEl));
  companiesObserver.observe(companiesEl, { childList: true });
</script>
